sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Designer
    participant FE as Frontend Analysis Page
    participant API as Backend API
    participant AS as Analysis Service
    participant DS as Supabase/Local Data

    U->>FE: Open Analysis Page
    FE->>API: GET /analysis
    API->>DS: Fetch colors dataset
    DS-->>API: Dataset rows
    API->>AS: Build frequency, yearWise, WCAG stats
    AS-->>API: Aggregated analysis result
    API-->>FE: JSON analysis payload
    FE-->>U: Render charts and trend summaries

